# END OF CONFIGURATION
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#
# VALIDATION CHECKLIST:
# [ ] All [REQUIRED] variables set with real values
# [ ] Secrets generated with strong random values (not placeholders)
# [ ] Database connection tested
# [ ] Redis/ValKey connection tested
# [ ] AI provider API keys validated
# [ ] OAuth providers configured with correct callback URLs
# [ ] Datadog keys configured (if using monitoring)
# [ ] File copied to .env.local (never commit to git)
#
# SECURITY REMINDERS:
# - Never commit .env or .env.local to version control
# - Rotate secrets regularly (quarterly minimum)
# - Use different secrets for dev/staging/production
# - Store production secrets in secure vault (Azure Key Vault, AWS Secrets Manager)
# - Review IAM permissions for service accounts
#
# TROUBLESHOOTING:
# - Check logs for "missing environment variable" errors
# - Verify connection strings with direct tool (psql, redis-cli)
# - Ensure firewall/security groups allow connections
# - Validate API keys in provider consoles
#
# DOCUMENTATION:
# - Full configuration guide: /docs/CONFIGURATION.md (coming soon)
# - Environment setup: /docs/SETUP.md
# - Deployment guide: /docs/DEPLOYMENT.md
#
